    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-english-classes/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Prime English Classes Theme is a tailored solution for educators, language schools, private tutors, online English academies, English coaching centers, ESL instructors, and training institutes offering English language courses. It’s designed to cater to a diverse audience, from students seeking intensive speaking courses to professionals enrolling in English for business communication, corporate English training, or functional English programs. This theme is perfect for building engaging, user-friendly websites that promote various services, including customized English courses, virtual English classes, interactive English workshops, online English lessons, grammar and vocabulary courses, pronunciation training, English conversation sessions, and English test preparation for exams like IELTS, TOEFL, and Cambridge English. Its modern design and functionality make it ideal for showcasing programs such as beginner English lessons, short-term English classes, advanced English courses, and daily practice sessions. For tutors and institutions, the theme provides immense benefits, featuring seamless scheduling tools and class booking systems through Contact Form 7 integration, allowing effortless management of live English classes or self-paced online courses. The layout emphasizes visual elements, with options to display vibrant banners, class schedules, course modules, and testimonials. Highlight English fluency programs, spoken English training, or business communication courses effectively through pre-built sections. Additionally, the theme is fully responsive, ensuring accessibility for users on all devices. With built-in customization options, educators can adapt the theme to suit their specific offerings, whether it’s individual English training or structured online programs. The Prime English Classes Theme empowers educators, tutors, and language institutes to create a dynamic online presence, attract students, and inspire language learners worldwide."
    },
